  "reference": "Mabonyo Gha Wadumi 9",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 43,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "9",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "ACT 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kughaluka kwa Sauli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngelo iro, Sauli orekoghe ukiwikumba wowa warumirii wa Bwana na kukunda kuwibwagha. Ukaghenda kwa Mkohani M'baa ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukalomba barua ughende naro sunagoginyi ra Dameshki, eri ukawona wandu wangi wawuyainugha Chia ya Bwana, womi angu waka, uwifunge na kuwireda Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji orekoghe ukidamba, ukavika kaavui na Dameshki, nao shwa mwengere ghukang'ala-ng'ala kufuma mlungunyi chia rose kwake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukaghwa andonyi, ukasikira lwaka lukimzera, “Sauli, Sauli! Kwaki kunikorongagha?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukaghamba, “Nani oho Bwana?” Nao ukaghamba, “Ini ne Jesu uhu kwawuyamkoronga; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela wuka kungie mzinyi, na oho kuchaghorelwa agho kuchaabonya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu orekoghe ukidambanya nawo, wikakaia kimusi kima; weresikireghe lwaka, ela ndeweremmbonieghe mndungi anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli ukawuka, hata iji walavua meso, nderedimieghe kuwona kindo chingi; wikammbwadia mkonu na kumdwa hata Dameshki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukakaia usewonagha kwa matuku adadu, na ngelo iyo nderejieghe hata kunywa kindo chingi anduangi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Dameshki, korekoghe na mnughi umu uwangwagha Anania. Bwana ukammbanga kwa mawono, “Anania!” Nao ukadika, “Neko aha Bwana.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwana ukamzera, “Wuka kughende ija chia iwangwagha Chia Ighorokie, kukotie nyumbenyi kwa Juda mundu uwangwagha Sauli wa muzi ghwa Tariso; huwu waawuyalomba Mlungu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nao wammbona mundu uwangwagha Anania ukingia na kummbikiria mikonu, eri upate kuwona sena.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Anania ukatumbulia, “Bwana, nasikire malagho gha uo mundu seji uwikorongie waeli wako aja Jerusalemu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na aha oko na nguma ufumie nayo kwa wakohani wabaa, upate kuwifunga wose wijighoragha irina jako.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Bwana ukamzera, “Ghenda, angu uo moni namsaghue ukaie chombo chapo chejidwa irina japo kwa mbari zima, na wazuri, na wandu wa Israeli; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "angu ini nichammbonyera seji ichaamfwana kutirirwa kwa wundu ghwa irina japo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Anania ukaghenda ukangia ija nyumba, ukammbikiria Sauli mikonu ukighamba, “Mwanidu Sauli, uja Bwana Jesu orekufutukieghe chienyi kukicha, waniduma kupate kuwona kwako na kuchulwa ni Roho Mweli.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao shwa wori vishindo vimu sa makoko vikapotoka kufuma mesonyi kwake, ukawoka kuwona sena. Nao ukawuka kimusi ukabaputizwa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukaja vindo ukapata ndighi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sauli kuchila andenyi ya Dameshki",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sauli orekaieghe andenyi ya Dameshki kwa matuku malazi gheni chiaimweri na wanughi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao shwa wori ukazoya kumchila Jesu andenyi ya masunagogi ukighamba, “Jesu ni Mwana wa Mlungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wose weremsikireghe wikashinika wikighamba, “Welee, uhu mundu suo moni orekoghe ukiwitotesha wandu awo werekoghe wikijighora iji irina Jerusalemu anguwada? Na aha nako oocha kwa wundu ugho ghoni, uwifunge na kuwighenja kwa wakohani wabaa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Sauli ukafunga ndighi kuchila na kuwinyamira Wayahudi werekoghe Dameshki kwa kuwiwonyera seji Jesu nuo Kristo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao iji ghaida matuku malazi, Wayahudi wikabonya njama em'bwagha Sauli;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CO.11.32+2CO.11.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Wakor. 11.32-33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela njama yawo ikamanyika kwa Sauli. Wikamlaliria mbengenyi kio na dime wim'bwaghe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ela wanughi wake wikamfunya nakio, na kumsera wurighenyi uko andenyi ya kikapu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sauli andenyi ya Jerusalemu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji Sauli wacha Jerusalemu, ukatima kuwadana na wanughi; ela wose wikamuobua angu ndewererumirieghe wei uo ni mnughi anduangi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Barnaba ukamdwa na kumreda kwa wadumi; ukawighoria seji Sauli ummbonie Bwana chienyi uo oreghorieghe nao, na seji uchilie kwa irina ja Jesu kwa wuwana andenyi ya Dameshki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko Sauli ukakaianya nawo, ukaghenda ii chia na ii chia andenyi ya Jerusalemu ukichila kwa wuwana kwa irina ja Bwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sena ukaja malagho na kusimana na Wayahudi wa Kigriki, ela awo wikalola kum'bwagha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela iji wanidu wamanya ilagho ijo, wikamghenja Kaisaria, na kumsigha ughende Tariso.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko ikanisa jikakaia na sere Judea kose, Galilaya na Samaria, jikiaghika kiroho; najo jikighenda imbiri kwa kumuobua Bwana, na kuhoreshwa ni Roho Mweli, jikachurikia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Petro kughenda Luda na Jopa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata iji Petro orekoghe ukighenda ii chia na ii chia aghadi yawo, ukasea kuwiwona waeli werekoghe wikikaia Luda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ukamkua mndumu aja uwangwagha Ainea uko na wukongo ghwa kupooza, ulale wulinyi miaka wunyanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petro ukamzera, “Ainea, Jesu Kristo wakuboisa, wuka kuale wuli ghwako.” Nao ukawuka shwa wori. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandu wose wa Luda na Sharoni wikammbona, wikamghalukia Bwana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na aja Jopa korekoghe na mnughi umu uwangwagha Tabitha, kigriki ni Dorkasi (kutambua kwaro ni shaa.) Muka uhu orekoghe na mabonyo mecha na kufunya makuwio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Matuku agho orewurieghe mkongo ukafwa, hata iji wamuoghosha, wikammbika chumbenyi gorofenyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na angu Luda korekoghe kaavui na Jopa, wanughi wikasikira angu Petro oko aho, nawo wikaduma wandu wawi kumzera, “Dakuvoya kudichee shwa-shwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petro ukawuka na kughendanya nawo. Nao iji wavika, wikamghenja gorofenyi. Waka wose wifulo ni womi, wikakaia kimusi kaavui nao wikilila, na kummbonyera Petro makoti na nguwo rose Dorkasi oreribonyereghe iji orekoghe moyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela Petro ukawifunya shighadi wose, ukadunga ngokoro ukalomba Mlungu; niko ukaighalukia gharia ukaghamba, “Tabitha wuka.” Nao ukalavua meso; hata iji wammbona Petro, ukasea kidombo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petro ukammbwada mkonu ukammbusira. Niko ukawiwanga waeli andwamweri na waka wifulo ni womi, ukamreda kwawo uko moyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilagho ijo jikamanyika isanga jose ja Jopa, na wengi wikamrumiria Bwana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ACT 9:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Petro ukakaia Jopa kwa matuku malazi andwamweri na mndumu ubonyagha kazi engira mirongo rangi, uwangwagha Simoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ACT.9.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ACT.9.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
